1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:15,015
Authority is delegated once, then only narrowed.

2
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:31,018
A prompt-injected agent asks for a payment outside its grant.

3
00:00:31,018 --> 00:00:47,011
The executor gate blocks it. The agent never touches the credentials.

4
00:00:47,011 --> 00:01:11,012
Anyone with the root public key can audit the transcript offline.

5
00:01:11,012 --> 00:01:25,011
Post-quantum signatures. Attenuated grants. Executor-side enforcement.

